      "type": "text",
      "text": " infections of the oral cavity caused by Candida albicans; infants: 2 mL (200,000 units) four times daily (1 mL in each side of mouth); children and adults: 4–6 mL (400,000–600,000 units) four times daily (half in each side of mouth); continue ≥ 48 h after perioral Sx resolve and/or cultures normalize; keep in the mouth as long as possible before swallowing."
